# Testing Rules

- Organize tests strictly into `tests/unit/`, `tests/integration/`, and `tests/e2e/`.
- Every feature must have automated test coverage.
- Run `python -m pytest` after changes and fix failing tests before marking complete.
- Verify both positive paths and negative failure/fault injection paths.
- Keep tests isolated using in-memory SQLite fixtures or fresh session teardowns.
